--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 002b9076b5a919941a76b7b86978d20e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 99_Ending
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Conversation
  showPanel: 1
  panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  panelColor: {r: 0.06, g: 0.07, b: 0.13, a: 1}
  panelTitle: A memory of the moon
  Lines:
  - text: Moonlight pours through the window. The restored glow of the mold becomes
      another memory.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Artemis, even the moon disappears from sight.
    npcId: 7
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Then how do people know it will return?
    npcId: 5
    style: 2
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They remember. They tell one another. They keep a place for it at the table.
    npcId: 7
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: To remember someone is not to keep them unchanged. It is to carry what
      remains, knowing something will always be missing.
    npcId: 7
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Chang'e. I remember your name.
    npcId: 5
    style: 1
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The memory fades. The Baker sets a tiny cat-shaped mooncake on the windowsill.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b23da1b493e8e844ac59ae8edd98a7a, type: 3}
  - text: Every helper deserves a share.
    npcId: 1
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The past does not return. It leaves us enough light to follow.
    npcId: 5
    style: 1
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Artemis takes a bite. The moon grows brighter, but does not become full.
      The mold glows while its crack remains visible. Fade to title and credits.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
